      <p source="#source-714-1306"><seg source="#source-714-780">先刻御見うけ申候通りニ、大兄の反したまふより</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-783-825"><seg source="#source-780-783">援</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-804-810">ママ</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-825-876">隊壮士三四等、ときの声を出し、ゑい</seg><choice source="#source-876-882"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-882-924">と押来り、くおふるに女軍吾本</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-927-969"><seg source="#source-924-927">陳</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-948-954">ママ</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-969-1071">お打破り其声百雷の（如）く、大兄此時ニもれたまふて、地下に吾に何の御</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1071-1089"><rb>顔</rb><rt>カホ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1089-1128">を見セたまふや。御心根御為</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1128-1140">レ</note><seg source="#source-1140-1143">聞</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1143-1212"><rb><seg source="#source-1146-1149">可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1149-1161">レ</note><seg source="#source-1161-1164">被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1164-1176">レ</note><seg source="#source-1176-1179">遣</seg></rb><rt>（つかはさるべく）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1212-1251">候。なぜに来りたまハぬや、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1251-1299"><rb><seg source="#source-1254-1260">御為</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1260-1272">レ</note><seg source="#source-1272-1275">聞</seg></rb><rt>（おきかせ）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1299-1306">。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1306-1335" style="padding-inline-end: 0em; text-align: right">
        <p source="#source-1324-1335"><seg source="#source-1324-1335">拝首。</seg></p>
